Build the API with Django 5 (Python 3.13) and the frontend with React (TypeScript, built with Vite). The backend serves the API and the frontend build. Store data in SQLite under `./data`.
The backend is a Django project in `backend/` (`backend/manage.py`, settings in `backend/config/`, dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`). The frontend is a Vite project in `frontend/`; `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`.
